Z||000000||Monkeyman||04-27-2000||06:51 PM||||Or...I didn't realize that Cliff was a cop.  I just read Cliffs final post to the thread that he just locked up.  This BS really is getting a little long in the tooth.  There are some members here who haven't posted as much lately.  I don't know all of thier reasons why, but maybe it's because of all of this "stuff" going on.  I know that I'm getting a little tired of it.<P>Cliff is a programmer (I think).  He started this forum because...OK, I don't know why he started it as I wasn't here, but I'm sure that he didn't want to be a policeman.  I seriously doubt that Cliff wants to trade in his programmers job for a full time forum cop.  C'mon, guys!  This has got to stop.  <P>Wanna hear something scary?  What happens if Cliff gets tired of the BS and decides to turn the forum off?  That would suck, wouldn't it?  <P>I enjoy it here.  If I didn't, I wouldn't return.  I think (for the most part) I've learned to stay away from the "hot" topics.  I sure wish everyone else would, too.  ||||reg||8
