Z||000008||batboy||04-27-2000||11:34 PM||||Actually BigBoy, in my opinion, I'd rather not see any changes. I enjoy Cliff's "laid back" style of moderating. He steps in when needed, like a father of two young boys when blood is shed, but otherwise stays out of the minor spats and arguments. That's not to say we shouldn't police ourselves. If I'm out of line, I hope someone tells me that I'm wrong (usually they do).<P>Everyone loses their cool occasionally. Takes a big person to realize they stirred things up and to apologize. Let's move on and not hold grudges. My Mom used to say, "If you don't have anything nice to say...SHUT UP!" My Dad told me, "It's better to keep your mouth closed and thought a fool, then to open it and remove all doubt."||||reg||1
